# ==============================================================================
# ReStockAI 2.0 Frontend — Build-Time Environment Variables (Vite)
# ==============================================================================
# In local dev (`npm run dev`), leave unset to use `http://127.0.0.1:8000`
# and `ws://localhost:8000/ws/office`.
#
# In Render Static Site production builds (`npm run build`), set:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://restockai-api.onrender.com
# Optional explicit WebSocket override (auto-derived as wss://.../ws/office from VITE_API_BASE_URL):
# VITE_WS_URL=wss://restockai-api.onrender.com/ws/office
